# Testing (Vitest)

Edit-time rules for test files and Vitest configs under `packages/`. Canonical map: [TESTING.md](../../docs/operations/TESTING.md). Commands: [SCRIPTS.md](../../docs/operations/SCRIPTS.md) only — do not copy script tables here.

**Scope:** `packages/**/*.test.ts(x)` and `packages/**/vitest.config.ts` — not `apps/**` (until catalog adds it). UI **source** under `components/**` → [ui-components.mdc](./ui-components.mdc). Types and JSDoc in tests → [typescript.mdc](./typescript.mdc), [code-commenting.mdc](./code-commenting.mdc).

**Co-attach:** `packages/ui/test/components/Button/Button.variants.test.ts` loads testing + typescript + commenting — **not** ui-components.

---

## Agent — do not run tests

Unless the user explicitly asks, do **not** run `pnpm *:test`, `vitest`, `pnpm check`, or other test gates.

After creating or editing tests or `vitest.config.ts`, end the response with:

```text
*** URADI TEST za: <scope> ***
```

| Touched area | Scope example | Suggest (from SCRIPTS.md) |
| ------------ | ------------- | ------------------------- |
| `packages/ui/` | `ui` | `pnpm ui:check` or `pnpm ui:test`; if `*.variants.ts` changed in UI source, mention audit in the note |
| `packages/tokens/` | `tokens` | `pnpm tokens:check` |
| `packages/registry/` | `registry` | `pnpm registry:check` |
| `packages/cli/` | `cli` | `pnpm --filter ./packages/cli check` |
| Multiple packages | list names or `full` | `pnpm check` only when user wants full gate |

Do not invent commands not listed in SCRIPTS.md.

---

## Layout

| Package | Config | Env | Test root |
| ------- | ------ | --- | --------- |
| tokens | `packages/tokens/vitest.config.ts` | node | `packages/tokens/test/` |
| ui | `packages/ui/vitest.config.ts` | jsdom | `packages/ui/test/components/<Name>/` |
| registry | `packages/registry/vitest.config.ts` | node | `packages/registry/test/` |
| cli | `packages/cli/vitest.config.ts` | node | `packages/cli/test/commands/`, `packages/cli/test/core/` |

No root workspace `vitest.config.ts`.

---

## Do not

- Add a root `vitest.config.ts`.
- Colocate UI tests next to `src/components/` — use `packages/ui/test/components/<Name>/`.
- Default to snapshot assertions.
- Duplicate UI variant or CVA rules here — [ui-components.mdc](./ui-components.mdc).

---

## UI test types

- `*.variants.test.ts` — primitive CVA class output.
- `*.render.test.tsx` — DOM smoke, className merge, key a11y roles.
- Blocks/templates — install smoke in CLI; render smoke in UI for pilots ([TESTING.md](../../docs/operations/TESTING.md)).

---

## Conventions

- Prefer behavior assertions over snapshots.
- CLI tests: mock filesystem/network at boundaries; temp dirs for install-flow.
- After editing primitive `*.variants.ts` (in UI source), remind user that `ui:check` includes token audit.

